\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 5. Scripts\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Seeking feedback
\f0\b0 \
"I'm working on getting better at [specific thing]. Could you tell me about one recent, specific moment where I could have handled it differently? A concrete example is more useful to me than general impressions."\

\f1\b Pausing before a reactive decision
\f0\b0 \
"That's an important point \'97 I want to think it through properly rather than answer off the cuff. I'll get back to you by [specific time]."\

\f1\b Giving credit
\f0\b0 \
"I want to be clear that [name] did the core work here \'97 specifically [detail]. That's what made this land."\

\f1\b Repairing harm
\f0\b0 \
"I've been thinking about [situation], and I think the way I handled it affected you in a way I didn't intend. I'd like to hear your perspective, and I want to know what I can do differently."\

\f1\b Responding ethically to conflict
\f0\b0 \
"It sounds like we see this differently. Before we decide, can we separate what's actually best for [the team/customer/goal] from either of our individual positions?"\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 6. Questions to ask before applying any of this\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Does my workplace culture actually reward the behaviour I'm trying to shift away from \'97 will this be harder to sustain here than it should be?\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Who is 1\'962 people I trust enough to give me honest, low-stakes feedback on how these changes are landing?\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Do I hold power over anyone in these interactions (as a manager, for instance) that changes how my experiments will be read or how much weight my words carry?\
