\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 7. A final caution\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Treat this profile as a hypothesis, not a verdict. Self-report questionnaires are shaped by self-perception and can't fully see your own blind spots \'97 corroborating this with honest feedback from a few trusted colleagues, or a coach, will tell you more than the score alone. And as you work through this: keep the reflection about your own behaviour, not a lens for labeling or diagnosing colleagues \'97 other people's privacy and dignity aren't material for this kind of self-assessment, however tempting the framework might be to apply outward.\
